{{also|tina|TINA|tína|tiña|tină|tïna|tiṇa}}
==English==

===Etymology===
Short form of {{l|en|Christina}} or of any female name ending in -tina, such as {{l|en|Martina}} or {{l|en|Albertina}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈtiːnə/|lang=en}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{given name|female|from=Ancient Greek|lang=en}}.
# A [[lake]] in [[Alaska]], near/around [[Anchorage]].

